{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53992","headline":"离别难 · 封特卿","name":"离别难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛许衆生愿，心坚石也穿。\n今朝虽送别，会却有明年。\n（均见《增修诗话总龟》卷二三引江邻几《杂志》。\n今本《江邻几杂志》无此条）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"封特卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}